{
  "name": "Telegram 整合 AI 智慧問答助理（含對話記憶）",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ✈️ 範例 5：Telegram 整合 AI 智慧助理\n\n1. **Telegram Trigger**：接收使用者提問。\n2. **Edit Fields (Set)**：提取 Chat ID、發訊者姓名與使用者問題。\n3. **AI Agent**：串接大型語言模型 (LLM)，並配置以 `chatId` 隔離的對話記憶 (Window Buffer Memory)。\n4. **Telegram Node**：將 AI 生成的智慧回答即時傳回 Telegram 聊天室。",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 430
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1344,
        672
      ],
      "id": "150bcd80-c70e-468a-87a0-a73f3f8b03fb",
      "name": "流程說明"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('提取提問內容與聊天室 ID').item.json.chatId }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.output }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown"
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        2192,
        944
      ],
      "id": "20beeb09-dce5-4fe8-8008-1ec16e886cb0",
      "name": "回傳 AI 智慧回答至 Telegram",
      "webhookId": "2e2e3b9a-7b61-401d-a691-16cad010573f",
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "aHqvp4EpI51iLIbw",
          "name": "Telegram account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "updates": [
          "message"
        ],
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "30e6a682-7930-4155-a5bf-f2cc67863f98",
      "name": "Telegram 訊息觸發器",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        1376,
        944
      ],
      "webhookId": "5f770ec6-6a9e-4a9b-a728-2fa37049e8ec",
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "aHqvp4EpI51iLIbw",
          "name": "Telegram account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "chat-id",
              "name": "chatId",
              "type": "number",
              "value": "={{ $json.message.chat.id }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "user-name",
              "name": "userName",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.message.from.first_name }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "user-message",
              "name": "userMessage",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ ($json.message.text || '').trim() }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e8a574d4-7bc1-42d8-a773-f5fe372846d6",
      "name": "提取提問內容與聊天室 ID",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.5,
      "position": [
        1616,
        944
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=使用者名稱：{{ $json.userName }}\n使用者提問：{{ $json.userMessage }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=你是一位專業、親切且高效的 Telegram 智慧助理。請遵循以下規則：\n1. 必須一律使用「繁體中文（台灣習慣用語）」進行回覆。\n2. 回答語氣友善親切，適度使用 emoji 增加互動感。\n3. 使用清晰易讀的 Markdown 條列式排版。\n4. 若使用者詢問先前的對話內容，請參考對話歷史記憶進行連貫回答。"
        }
      },
      "id": "6cd864f7-7a06-4b9e-84a1-715c49f38118",
      "name": "AI 智慧問答助理",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        1856,
        944
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash"
        },
        "responsesApiEnabled": false,
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.7
        }
      },
      "id": "0a4a5f6e-4697-4a82-b781-9692297c9df8",
